    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Go For the Heart</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After accidentally transporting themself back in time to the Fright Zone of their momsâ€™ childhood Finn must try to blend in while waiting for an opportunity to get home. Adora and Catra are frantic to find their baby and bring them back. Shadow Weaver thinks she can use this to her advantage&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
